1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,520
Early stage Soul Formation ?

25
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,040
This is a great opportunity,

26
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:09,040
we should act now !

27
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,190
Master,

28
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,320
don't scare me like that.

29
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,360
My Origin Soul got damaged.

30
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,000
I need to recover as soon as possible.

31
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,200
Fellow cultivator,

32
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,650
what happened to cause you

33
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,080
to end up in such a state ?

34
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,280
Giant Demon Clan ?

35
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:56,720
A Celestial Realm fragment collapse.

36
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,800
Fellow cultivator,

37
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,280
not just anyone can escape

38
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,600
the collapse of a Celestial Realm fragment.

39
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,200
I'm Chi Hu of the Giant Demon Clan.

40
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,690
What's your name ?

41
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,720
I'm Ceng Niu.

42
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,880
Ceng Niu...

43
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,640
Is this cultivator part of

44
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,840
the Ceng family of the rank 5

45
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:20,050
country of Heaven Soul from Suzaku ?

46
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:23,120
He is Early stage Soul Formation at such a young age

47
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,520
and he can even control wandering souls...

48
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:29,200
He must be the core disciple of a rank 5 country.

49
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,000
Fellow cultivator,

50
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,920
can I come closer to talk ?

51
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:45,480
Brother Ceng,

52
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,480
I'll be frank with you.

53
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,710
Since we are both from Suzaku,

54
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,080
I hope you can help me.

55
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,720
Once you see this, you will understand.

56
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:02,920
Jade coffin
Central fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

57
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,200
A coffin made of celestial jades ?!

58
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,760
So there are such treasures in the Celestial Realm...

59
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,120
Brother Ceng,

60
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,200
that place was found many years ago

61
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:14,400
by a genius of my clan

62
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,760
when he came in here.

63
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,490
That place

64
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:18,840
is guarded by celestial beasts

65
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:21,240
and powerful restrictions.

66
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,800
As he wasn't powerful enough,

67
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,080
he didn't act recklessly.

68
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,600
He recorded his sight in this jade

69
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,800
and returned safely.

70
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,360
It has been many years.

71
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,760
It probably has been found by someone.

72
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:34,720
Not possible !

73
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,080
I promise you this place has not been found.

74
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,560
There is a reason,

75
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,120
but I cannot tell you right now.

76
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,160
Forgive me Brother Ceng.

77
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,160
Chi Hu and I are complete strangers

78
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,040
but he wants to team up with me...

79
00:04:49,730 --> 00:04:52,600
He must have really liked my wandering souls.

80
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,800
I'm afraid it will be hard

81
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,000
for just the both of us to get there.

82
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,320
To be honest,

83
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,350
I have also asked

84
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:01,760
another person for help.

85
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,480
If the three of us go,

86
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,320
I’m pretty confident that we will get there.

87
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,640
But don't worry Brother Ceng,

88
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,120
we will divide equally

89
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,800
the treasures we will find.

90
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,520
Take your time to consider my offer.

91
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,520
If you agree,

92
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,680
in one month,

93
00:05:16,730 --> 00:05:19,200
use this jade to teleport to my fragment.

94
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,800
Brother Ceng,

95
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,200
I hope you will join me !

96
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,960
First of all, I need to recover.

97
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:34,240
I'd rather not take any risks

98
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,920
A few days later

99
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,400
Celestial spiritual energy

100
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,880
before the Soul Transformation breakthrough

101
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,480
cannot be used.

102
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,640
It's a poison if I try to absorb it before that point.

103
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,800
Fortunately, I gained a lot from this trip.

104
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,640
This is a naturally formed celestial jade.

105
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,230
The celestial spiritual energy inside it

106
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,280
is way stronger than the ones I condensed.

107
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,090
To cultivate after Soul Transformation,

108
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:12,360
this one is even more efficient.

109
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,920
But this thing doesn't look

110
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,400
like a defensive artifact.

111
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,560
What an ingenious technique !

112
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:33,000
It turns out this jade was carved by an ancient Celestial !

113
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:48,080
Tian Bao
Heavenly Treasure Celestial

114
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:49,440
I am Tian Bao, the Heavenly Treasure Celestial.

115
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:52,440
I have always dreamed of creating

116
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:56,040
the most powerful artifact in existence.

117
00:06:57,240 --> 00:07:00,440
This dream of mine has ended

118
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:04,360
with the destruction of the Celestial Realm.

119
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:08,310
I have sealed my God Slaying Chariot in a cave.

120
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:13,560
If someone ever obtains this jade,

121
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,880
please retrieve it.

122
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,600
The God Slaying Chariot ?

123
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,720
This artifact

124
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:23,200
might still be in Tian Bao's cave !

125
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,240
A celestial artifact is incomparable

126
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,050
to artifacts of our world.

127
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,720
I must not miss

128
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:30,520
this opportunity.

129
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:36,920
10 days later

130
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:39,360
Stone Forest Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

131
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:41,240
I have already searched all the fragments

132
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,840
of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

133
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,950
The Celestial Realm is vast,

134
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,600
if the cave isn't somewhere I can teleport to,

135
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,800
it will take me a long time to find.

136
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,200
Fellow cultivator,

137
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,120
save me !

138
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,960
Sima Yun
Shattered Silver Planet, Kui Shui Sect
Early stage Soul Formation

139
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,440
Fellow cultivator,

140
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,880
this has nothing to do with you.

141
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:09,960
Please leave.

142
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,760
He tried to steal my celestial jade.

143
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,240
If you help me to kill him,

144
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,600
we can split evenly !

145
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,480
Nonsense !

146
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:20,000
You're the one that stole from me.

147
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,000
We both come from planet Suzaku,

148
00:08:27,090 --> 00:08:28,240
help me this once !

149
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:28,920
Scram !

150
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:32,200
Don't get me involved in this matter between you two.

151
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,000
Since you aren't willing to help,

152
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,680
then I might as well pass the buck.

153
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:39,800
I don't want

154
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,200
this celestial jade anymore !

155
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,680
Thank you.

156
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,720
I am Sima Yun from the Kui Shui Sect.

157
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,240
And fellow cultivator is ?

158
00:09:02,110 --> 00:09:02,930
Ceng Niu.

159
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,020
Fellow cultivator Ceng,

160
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,840
I have been searching here for a few days,

161
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,240
there is no more celestial spiritual energy left.

162
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,640
Don't waste your time.

163
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
I don't know if you have any teleportation formations locations.

164
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,030
But if you do,

165
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,480
maybe we can exchange them.

166
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:19,640
He should also have a map of teleportation formations given by his sect.

167
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,800
What will you exchange with me ?

168
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,920
This person has 5 fragments

169
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:36,280
on the western side.

170
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,420
Fellow cultivator Ceng,

171
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,710
my map has 21 fragments

172
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,480
and 8 of them overlap with yours.

173
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,660
How about we trade

174
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,200
after you wipe off a few.

175
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,400
Fellow cultivator Ceng,

176
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,360
if you have the chance to come to my planet,

177
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,640
I’ll certainly welcome you.

178
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,120
Sure.

179
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,160
I shall take my leave.

180
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,400
Since that bastard tried to steal from me,

181
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,280
I will definitely not let him get away.

182
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:07,440
It seems that

183
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:09,560
the fragments of the Da Lou Sword Sect

184
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:13,200
were just the tip of the iceberg of the Celestial Realm.

185
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:16,600
Tiger Mountain Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

186
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:27,640
I found it !

187
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,840
A tiger-shaped mountain ?

188
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,410
Such a place really exists ?

189
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:52,000
Celestial Tian Bao's cave
Tiger Mountain Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

190
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,640
It seems that it has already been looted.

191
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,880
That's a shame, it was so hard to find this place.

192
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,440
The God Slaying Chariot

193
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:24,480
is sealed in the 10th room of the cave,

194
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,760
waiting for the one destined for it.

195
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:29,400
There are only 9 rooms in this cave.

196
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,840
Where is the 10th ?

197
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:35,720
The God Slaying Chariot is my life's work.

198
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,960
If it can be completed,

199
00:11:38,950 --> 00:11:39,640
I...

200
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:42,280
won't have any regrets.

201
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,680
The cave is sinking.

202
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:52,200
Even if people found this cave, very few would be able

203
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:54,800
to find the room with the real treasure inside.

204
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,560
I don't know

205
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,440
what's in this room.

206
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:28,000
God Slaying Chariots

207
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,680
It looks like a celestial beast

208
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,200
that has come back to life.

209
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,600
This is

210
00:12:36,850 --> 00:12:38,200
the God Slaying Chariot !

211
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:54,160
Fei
Soul of the God Slaying Chariot

212
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,240
What an overwhelming pressure !

213
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,230
The smallest of those beasts

214
00:12:57,360 --> 00:13:00,240
is stronger than the 9-headed dragon in the Land of the Ancient God.

215
00:13:00,730 --> 00:13:03,320
Although the jade didn't record the name of those beasts,

216
00:13:04,090 --> 00:13:05,440
it did mention that

217
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,690
each chariot has chains to bind them.

218
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,080
So they can't move more than 9 meters away.

219
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,120
Using the God Slaying Chariot

220
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,920
with my Soul Formation cultivation

221
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,560
is impossible.

222
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:24,040
I can only seal these beasts for now.

223
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,320
Celestial Tian Bao wouldn't have thought that

224
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,200
his inestimable celestial artifacts would end up

225
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:41,160
in the hands of an Early stage Soul Formation.

226
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,520
Seal !

227
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,200
This God Slaying Chariot is so ingenious,

228
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:05,960
it's being powered by the beast soul inside.

229
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:07,800
I'm sure that

230
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,720
its power won't disappoint me.

231
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:12,720
This is the smallest of the 3 beasts

232
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,080
so maybe I can use the Beast Trap on it.

233
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:17,520
But even if the Beast Trap works,

234
00:14:17,710 --> 00:14:19,240
will I be able to withstand

235
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:21,840
the absorption of spiritual energy ?

236
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,000
The harvest on this trip

237
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,560
has been very good.

238
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:35,120
But it also was dangerous.

239
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,240
If anything had gone wrong during that fragment collapse,

240
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,000
I would be dead by now.

241
00:14:41,350 --> 00:14:42,320
Therefore,

242
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,520
I have to carefully consider

243
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,560
Chi Hu's invitation.

244
00:14:47,230 --> 00:14:49,000
Not to mention the 3 celestial swords,

245
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,200
the celestial jade coffin

246
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:53,840
will be crucial for my future Soul Transformation.

247
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:56,550
As long as my cultivation reaches Soul Transformation,

248
00:14:56,570 --> 00:14:58,200
I will be able to wake up Senior Situ.

249
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,840
I can also bring some

250
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:03,520
celestial herbs back to Wan'er.

251
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:15,240
Central Cold Fragment Entrance
Rain Celestial Realm

252
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,800
They're here.

253
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:17,960
I just don't know

254
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,280
which one it is.

255
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:37,800
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

256
00:15:37,810 --> 00:15:39,240
I've been waiting for you.

257
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,840
If what you said is false,

258
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:45,680
I won’t let this end so easily !

259
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,800
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly can relax.

260
00:15:47,810 --> 00:15:48,720
This jade was made

261
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:51,360
by my Giant Demon Clan’s Ancestor, Xi Zu.

262
00:15:52,570 --> 00:15:54,680
He should have no reason to lie.

263
00:15:55,700 --> 00:15:56,600
Xi Zu ?

264
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,040
On planet Suzaku,

265
00:15:59,050 --> 00:16:00,960
my Giant Demon Clan and your country of Xue Yue

266
00:16:00,970 --> 00:16:03,120
are the only non natives to the planet.

267
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:05,920
Xi Zu and your master were friends.

268
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:08,000
How could I lie to you ?

269
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,480
Since it was recorded by Xi Zu himself,

270
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:13,920
then I'll believe you and go on this trip.

271
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:15,760
The only treasure I want

272
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,040
is that jade coffin.

273
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,520
It must be mine !

274
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,800
She really is too overbearing.

275
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:27,240
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

276
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,840
this matter is not so easily decided.

277
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,720
After all, besides the two of us,

278
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,720
one more person

279
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:34,000
should also join us on this trip.

280
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:35,200
I've promised him that

281
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,480
if the three of us work together,

282
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:38,640
we would split

283
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,160
all the treasures we find

284
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:42,200
evenly among us.

285
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,720
Since I'm the young master of the Giant Demon Clan,

286
00:16:45,990 --> 00:16:47,360
I must keep my word.

287
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:48,680
Oh ?

288
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:49,640
And who is it ?

289
00:16:50,350 --> 00:16:51,240
Ceng Niu.

290
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:53,880
Just like you and me,

291
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:55,370
he comes from planet Suzaku.

292
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,680
From planet Suzaku ?

293
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:00,790
Brother Ceng !

294
00:17:00,810 --> 00:17:02,250
So you did come afterall.

295
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:04,280
It's you !

296
00:17:19,790 --> 00:17:26,470
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

297
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:32,630
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

298
00:17:32,740 --> 00:17:36,570
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

299
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:40,500
and like many other unseparable things.

300
00:17:40,860 --> 00:17:46,510
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

301
00:17:47,690 --> 00:17:53,520
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

302
00:17:53,830 --> 00:17:59,370
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

303
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:04,050
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

304
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:07,540
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

305
00:18:07,710 --> 00:18:13,530
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

306
00:18:14,050 --> 00:18:17,730
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

307
00:18:17,830 --> 00:18:21,650
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

308
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:27,500
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

309
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:31,430
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

310
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:35,210
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

311
00:18:35,330 --> 00:18:41,250
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

312
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:45,330
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

313
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:49,150
Life and death are just moments away,
